[32m✔ billing settles real provider usage above the authorization when the released balance covers it [90m(8028.0355ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ usage summary keeps project attribution as an authorization-time snapshot and separates unassigned history [90m(6867.0807ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ project snapshot backfill only restores an unambiguous owned generation [90m(3732.0166ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ billing keeps the authorization frozen for reconciliation when actual usage exceeds releasable balance [90m(2905.1608ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ an administrator can collect a historical capped-settlement difference exactly once [90m(3133.5186ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ bulk historical settlement repair collects every eligible user and reports insufficient balances [90m(3388.5504ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ setting a balance targets the requested amount instead of adding to it [90m(2256.2882ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ admin grants are additive and idempotent while lifetime consumption remains independent [90m(2098.6142ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ billing, usage, and audit logs expose stable server-side pagination [90m(2411.58ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ expired reconciliation releases the frozen authorization and leaves an audit trail [90m(2273.2316ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ three pending reconciliations for one model rate-limit later calls [90m(2227.7633ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ passwords have no format rule beyond being non-empty [90m(2562.8234ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ self registration creates a normal user and an authenticated session [90m(2452.3223ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ a user can change a unique username and receives a session for the new identity [90m(2152.9566ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ published price books require explicit, positive or free prices [90m(1881.8867ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ conditional video token rates use integer points with no floating point drift [90m(2315.9528ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ conditional video rates prefer the most specific matching rule and reject ambiguity [90m(2241.6177ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ token price tiers use only canonical usage and reject uncovered ranges [90m(2198.3799ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ micro-points preserve a non-zero charge for low token usage [90m(2160.206ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ billing precision migration is idempotent after the ledger is converted [90m(2437.0092ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ creator model list never exposes provider credentials [90m(1878.1405ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ custom provider billing keys isolate identical provider model names [90m(1790.7944ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ drama listing is scoped by owner [90m(2596.496ms)[39m[39m
[32m✔ omni sequences and tool runs stay scoped and settle their authorization [90m(3986.4922ms)[39m[39m
